{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260jDsFeAnrj1795408388.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港澳辦和中聯辦分別祝賀，選委會界別分組一般選舉順利完成。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HMO-0930.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265Y8LyOmpAc1795400988.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>港澳辦發言人指，新選舉制度的先進性和優越性，展現符合香港高質量民主新氣象。候選人圍繞對接國家「十五五」規劃，落實香港首個五年規劃，加快北部都會區建設，以及推動產業轉型等議題比拼政綱。選舉進一步落實「愛國者治港」原則，凝聚社會集中精力發展經濟，改善民生的共識。</p><p></p><p>希望新一屆委員，支持特區政府依法施政，提升治理效能，推動香港更好融入，和服務國家發展大局。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207832-%E9%81%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E8%BE%A6%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%80%E5%B1%86%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%B1%95%E7%8F%BE%E9%AB%98%E5%93%81%E8%B3%AA%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1%E5%85%A8%E6%96%87\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">選委會選舉｜港澳辦：新一屆選舉展現高品質民主新氣象｜全文</a></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HMO-0930_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ud5cbUXJEJ1795400986.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中聯辦發言人就稱，新一屆選委的任期，與香港五年規劃周期基本一致，期望新一屆選委全力支持，行政長官及特區政府施政，推動「四中心、一高地」，北部都會區以及粵港澳大灣區發展，保持香港繁榮穩定。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207833-%E9%81%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E4%B8%AD%E8%81%AF%E8%BE%A6%E5%84%AA%E4%B8%AD%E9%81%B8%E5%84%AA%E5%B1%95%E7%8F%BE%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1%E9%81%B8%E8%B3%A2%E4%BB%BB%E8%83%BD%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%B1%80%E5%85%A8%E6%96%87\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">選委會選舉｜中聯辦︰優中選優展現新氣象　選賢任能開創新局｜全文</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.849021+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:05:54.839788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:21.335978+00:00","content_hash":"c59186df671f18c271304289a6ce49869711a763bb56ced38291141ff59f8a61","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}